      "principle": "A presumption of marriage cannot be drawn in a case where the alleged marriage is during a time when second marriage is prohibited in law.",
      "held": "When it is admitted by plaintiffs that a marriage was solemnized in 2001, another marriage earlier about 16 years back cannot be presumed.",
